Package: fosos-welcome
Version: 0.1.1
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, firefox-esr, network-manager
Maintainer: FosOS <dev@fosos.local>
Description: FosOS first-login welcome
 Shows network status, opens the FosOS guide, and on an installed system
 offers to install updates. The live session can start the installer from here.
 Firefox is the only browser this screen offers.
